      "anchor": {
        "file": "main.tex",
        "from": 790,
        "to": 794,
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-bb13547aabb21b102bd3487189b14874b46ddc919944d4f98a8ae5cadccf28b0"
      },
      "text": "(1 - epsilon) d_TV(P,Q) <= D~ <= (1 + epsilon) d_TV(P,Q) with probability at least 1 - eta.",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-6d8e54e8c89c4a344593ee45b966d0be67d9082e724f185223be3953de344b6a",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "main.tex",
          "from": 790,
          "to": 794,
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-bb13547aabb21b102bd3487189b14874b46ddc919944d4f98a8ae5cadccf28b0"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:e9639daf-ee11-4c18-8c43-654d1a6786c3",
      "claimId": "claim:2155948e-5617-4b7c-9aa4-e8be76611e3d",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:5bf98b5b-cfef-47a7-b239-c471a3076520",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "main.tex",
        "from": 794,
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-12bb02c5681752e8e9b4eee1dcbee34d31130bb05c5926152cd5e2a46d57619f"
      },
      "text": "The algorithm runs in time polynomial in n, k, 1/epsilon, log(1/eta) and max_t |Omega_t|.",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-117a311f0682caec775743018bf9ea3587ff38c8e3c699632083e00a7cfd1c20",
      "kind": "time",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "main.tex",
          "from": 794,
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-12bb02c5681752e8e9b4eee1dcbee34d31130bb05c5926152cd5e2a46d57619f"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:f3dc180e-7a4b-421e-84f9-36ef7829afac",
      "claimId": "claim:0dca25b9-722d-46c3-8e87-2b68af79d580",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:5bf98b5b-cfef-47a7-b239-c471a3076520",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "lem:one_step, main.tex",
        "from": 802,
        "to": 811,
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-2e616e721f3835e4148fbeb795b597ffe8bc66fbfe17454fc0d927f64acb51ac"
      },
      "text": "Per-step: with probability at least 1 - eta', (1 - delta) E(U_t, y) <= E(C_t, y) <= (1 + delta) E(U_t, y) simultaneously for all y in R^k.",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-5993869a24b8ffe47064ae8ae57293a7ada3f268f783fca93dd2a00e3043088f",
      "kind": "probability",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "lem:one_step, main.tex",
          "from": 802,
          "to": 811,
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-2e616e721f3835e4148fbeb795b597ffe8bc66fbfe17454fc0d927f64acb51ac"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:1b7ef287-bc16-4d70-a9ba-5d5b22fb4a8c",
      "claimId": "claim:9363956c-8571-4f46-a854-2f329fc60a75",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:5bf98b5b-cfef-47a7-b239-c471a3076520",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "lem:propagation, main.tex",
        "from": 823,
        "to": 840,
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-08ed328f1e826f1ec8ec518bd2d010930e83b1dd4fcc9d86361957790f29d1b9"
      },
      "text": "Conditioned on Sparsify succeeding at step t, (1 - delta) F_{t-1} <= F_t <= (1 + delta) F_{t-1}.",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-dc32b3d49c693e2ab4e83c8d7e1da8874a33930331da54e5f4a3da0d3bcb6e0d",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "lem:propagation, main.tex",
          "from": 823,
          "to": 840,
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-08ed328f1e826f1ec8ec518bd2d010930e83b1dd4fcc9d86361957790f29d1b9"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:fe9ff7f8-5ea5-4eef-94ee-21749fdaf561",
      "claimId": "claim:d07552f9-5b0e-4280-89fe-34f04b55a4c1",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:5bf98b5b-cfef-47a7-b239-c471a3076520",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "main.tex",
        "from": 843,
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-1a8c530d78c6fd277090ec666312c6c5f2ce0ab3a9cec9bb7ce87d396160b794"
      },
      "text": "Union bound: all n steps succeed with probability at least 1 - n eta' = 1 - eta.",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-6538da32b5dff64f38b31d3d1fd67b3c4a3af642352225ff10dbd297d0e2e7e8",
      "kind": "probability",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "main.tex",
          "from": 843,
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-1a8c530d78c6fd277090ec666312c6c5f2ce0ab3a9cec9bb7ce87d396160b794"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:2d8231f8-4804-40ee-8cd1-f60440bb0769",
      "claimId": "claim:84c47eb4-04bc-44f3-bff7-742dc24ac1e9",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:5bf98b5b-cfef-47a7-b239-c471a3076520",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "main.tex",
        "from": 845,
        "to": 847,
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-e178b64268ef1a0a9ce9db81c6d09ca64a86d78b636b668fcfaca2af18276dfc"
      },
      "text": "Telescoping and calibration: (1 - delta)^n F_0 <= F_n <= (1 + delta)^n F_0 and, at delta = epsilon/(3n), (1 + epsilon/3n)^n <= e^{epsilon/3} <= 1 + epsilon and (1 - epsilon/3n)^n >= 1 - epsilon.",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-e02408ab0516175e590db0d0534549544bb1554666e251ca0cd4506cdda50d4c",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "file": "main.tex",
          "from": 845,
          "to": 847,
          "excerptDigest": "sha256-e178b64268ef1a0a9ce9db81c6d09ca64a86d78b636b668fcfaca2af18276dfc"
        }
      ],
      "status": "active"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-version:973b1631-c25d-43f7-8e63-fff1358629bd",
      "claimId": "claim:14631791-7dc5-4f79-aca5-3802b0f853b9",
      "targetVersionId": "target-version:5bf98b5b-cfef-47a7-b239-c471a3076520",
      "anchor": {
        "file": "main.tex",
        "from": 821,
        "excerptDigest": "sha256-4c05dfc6b7511de02623398a249d4f2926b516522b3e6faabb095f6b0ca5bd57"
      },
      "text": "F_0 = d_TV(P,Q) and F_n = D~.",
      "normalizedTextDigest": "sha256-f6e878901650121eeefeb02d96b35b0d65e1029f66a3a0cb3d3980034b8b01dd",
      "kind": "correctness",
      "evidence": [
